# Code Changes

## Code Changes

When making code changes:
- DO NOT create markdown documentation files (*.md) unless explicitly requested by the user
- DO NOT create summary files, changelog files, or progress reports automatically
- Focus on implementing, testing, and fixing code
- Only document in code comments and docstrings

## Exceptions

Create markdown files ONLY when:
- User explicitly asks for documentation
- Creating/updating README.md for a new project
- Technical specs are specifically requested
